@startuml

title EduSurvey - Create and Publish Survey

actor Lecturer
participant "EduSurvey" as System
database "Database" as DB

Lecturer -> System: Sign in
System -> DB: Verify lecturer account
DB --> System: Account verified
System --> Lecturer: Display lecturer dashboard

Lecturer -> System: Create new survey
System --> Lecturer: Display survey form

Lecturer -> System: Enter survey details
Lecturer -> System: Submit survey

System -> System: Validate survey

alt Survey is valid
    System -> DB: Save survey
    DB --> System: Survey saved
    System --> Lecturer: Show survey created

    Lecturer -> System: Publish survey
    System -> DB: Update survey status to Published
    DB --> System: Status updated
    System --> Lecturer: Show publication confirmation

else Survey is invalid
    System --> Lecturer: Show validation errors
    Lecturer -> System: Correct survey details
    Lecturer -> System: Submit survey again
    System -> DB: Save survey
    DB --> System: Survey saved
end

@enduml
